### Gravity Generator

## UI
gravity-generator-window-title = 重力发生器

## UI field names
gravity-generator-window-status = 状态：
gravity-generator-window-power = 电源：
gravity-generator-window-eta = 预计时间：
gravity-generator-window-charge = 充能：

## UI statuses
gravity-generator-window-status-fully-charged = 已充满
gravity-generator-window-status-off = 关闭
gravity-generator-window-status-charging = 正在充能
gravity-generator-window-status-discharging = 正在放电

## UI Power Buttons
gravity-generator-window-power-on = 开启
gravity-generator-window-power-off = 关闭
gravity-generator-window-power-label = { $draw } / { $max } W

## UI ETA label
gravity-generator-window-eta-none = N/A
gravity-generator-window-eta-value = 剩余 { TOSTRING($left, "m\\:ss") }

## Popup
gravity-generator-unanchoring-failed = 无法解除运行中的重力发生器的锚定。
